      <activity id="4ab21db3-cb6d-5ad3-8fb0-4fa093d2613b" activityNameId="099f250f-1aec-5484-9968-368cc91317e6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tin, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tin, at regional storage
Most data are calculated based on assumptions and theoretical models. Their overall quality is poor.;
CAS number: 007440-31-5; 
Formula: Sn; 
UUID: 128906db-c099-3e6a-806c-83b9fb5b86f5
The cradle to gate inventory of world-wide primary tin production includes mining, beneficiation, smelting and refining of tin ore and tin respectively. Also included are the transports from the major producers to Europe.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data relate to an assumed average technology for mining, beneficiation, smelting and refining.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: &gt; 280'000 tonnes per year (worldwide)
Sampling: based on literature and internet 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_128906db-c099-3e6a-806c-83b9fb5b86f5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
